`]}),e.jsx(n,{title:"Width transfer outside the papers that proposed it",children:e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["Does width transfer hold beyond the papers that proposed it, in released models? Cerebras-GPT's μP variants, tuned on a 40M proxy, span 111M to 2.7B, while its standard family spans 111M to 13B ",e.jsx(s,{id:"dey2023cerebras",children:"Dey et al., 2023a"}),". Everett et al. find the same without the μP label: each parametrization they tested transfers once every layer gets its own learning-rate exponent and tuned constant ",e.jsx(s,{id:"everett2024scaling",children:"Everett et al., 2024"}),". ",e.jsx(s,{id:"dey2023btlm",paren:!1,children:"BTLM"}),", ",e.jsx(s,{id:"hu2024minicpm",paren:!1,children:"MiniCPM"}),", ",e.jsx(s,{id:"zuo2025falconh1",paren:!1,children:"Falcon-H1"})," and ",e.jsx(s,{id:"cohere2025commanda",paren:!1,children:"Command A"})," ship μP-style width transfer, and ",e.jsx(s,{id:"meituan2025longcat",paren:!1,children:"LongCat-Flash"})," ships Everett et al.'s rule. Testing how well one of these rules transfers on the course's model would make a good final project."]})})]}),e.jsxs(r,{title:"Depth transfer",optional:!0,accent:6,number:"22",items:"4",children:[e.jsxs(t.ul,{children:[`
